            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Presentation</h2><br>IronBorn is the latest RPG by Valkyria, the developer behind Valiant, and published by RPG veterans Aldorlea Games.<br>Featuring a gameplay and visuals reminiscent of the 16-bit console era, this game is a must-have for fans of old-school RPG.<br>Take control of Dale and his wolf Snow, have several characters join you on your quest and battle the enemies until emerge victorious!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plot</h2><br>What if you discovered that you have the power to stop an evil menace?<br>What if you discovered that to complete that journey, you would have to face your own brother?<br><br>Join Dale and his friends on a quest of self-discovery, friendship and heroism!<br>Become the IronBorn and save the world!<br><br>It's for more than just glory, it's for the humankind.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Games</h2><br><br><br><br><br>",
