                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "🎮 IRONBORN Review ⭐☆☆☆☆ (1/5)\n\nI don't know what to say about this game to make it likeable 🤷‍♂️\n\n😑 Multiple Problems Not sure what bothers me more: • 👙 Way too skimpy clothing for female characters – feels like cheap fan service instead of good design • 🎬 \"To Be Continued\" ending – just feels incomplete and lazy\n\n📅 No Hope for Sequel The game came out in 2018 and I still can't find Ironborn Part 2 anywhere 🔍 At this point, I doubt they'll ever finish it 💔\n\n💶 Bottom Line ❌ Not worth full price ❌ Not even worth €1 on sale ❌ Skip it entirely\n\nSave your money and play literally anything else instead 🏃‍♂️",
